    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251216001744\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"400\"><img alt=\"400\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c6/Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251216001744\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"825\" height=\"1406\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Fressa Sherbet Princess Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>雪酪公主</b>\n</p><p>一位传说在表演中编织冰之魔法的旅行舞者。她在冰封舞台上旋转、跳跃、滑行，令无数男子为之倾倒，而与这些着迷者同样多的，是因一时大意而被她的魔法之力击溃、粉碎、四散奔逃的人。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:79px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Fressa Sherbet Princess S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (345 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:79px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/Fressa_Sherbet_Princess_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scal